{"sourceUrl":"http://phymech.whut.edu.cn/rcpy/yjszs/ssyjszs/202609/t20260917_1418069.shtml","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:10.132043+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://phymech.whut.edu.cn/rcpy/yjszs/ssyjszs/202609/t20260917_1418069.shtml","html":"<article>\n<div>\n<h3>\n                        武汉理工大学物理与力学学院2027年推荐免试攻读硕士学位（直接攻读博士学位）研究生招生简章\n                    </h3>\n<span>　发布时间：2026-09-17</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><p><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务。符合学校规定的推免生申请基本条件。</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span>本科期间学习成绩优良、品德表现良好，遵纪守法，身心健康，诚实守信，学风端正，无考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果或其他违法违纪行为，无受处分（处罚）记录。</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span><span>能取得就读高校推荐免试资格的</span><span>2027</span><span>届应届本科毕业生</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>并在教育部</span><span>“推免服务系统”报名成功者。</span></span></p><p><span>4.</span><span><span>入学前须取得本科毕业证书和学士学位证书</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>5.<span>申请直接攻读博士学位者，应具有较强的科研创新能力和培养潜力</span></span><span><span>，在报名前与拟报考导师联系，取得导师同意后报考，并致电备案。</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.</span><span>招收推免生本科毕业专业限制：</span></span></p><p><span><span>物理学：物理学、天文学、电子信息、材料、地球物理学等与物理学学科相关专业。</span></span></p><p><span><span>力</span></span><span><span>学：工程力学、理论与应用力学、材料、土木工程、车辆工程等与力学学科相关专业。</span></span></p><p><span><span>光电信息工程：物理学、电子信息、材料等与物理学学科相关专业。</span></span></p><p><span><span>低空技术与工程：工程力学、理论与应用力学、航空工程等与力学学科相关专业。</span></span></p><p><span><span>二、招生类别和招生人数</span></span></p><p><span><span>（一）本科直博生</span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span>  序号</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span> 专业名称</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>  专业代码</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>   学习形式</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span> 拟招生人数</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>   1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>  物理学</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>   070200</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span> 2</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>   2</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>   力</span></span><span><span>学</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>   080100</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span> 2</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>  合计</span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"3\"><br/></td><td><p><span><span> 4</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span>注：本科直博生实际招生人数可根据生源情况适当调整。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）硕士研究生</span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span> 序号</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>专业名称</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span> 专业代码</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>  学习形式</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>   拟招生人数</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>  1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span> 物理学</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>  070200</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>   全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>    8</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>  2</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>  力</span></span><span><span>学</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>  080100</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>   全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>  27（本硕班21人）</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>  3</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>  光电信息工程</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>  085408</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>   全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>    2</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>  4</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>  低空技术与工程</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>  0801J1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>   全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>    1</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span> 合计</span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"3\"><br/></td><td><p><span><span>        38</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span>注：硕士研究生实际招生人数可根据生源情况适当调整。</span></span></p><p><span>三、</span><span><span>申请、复试、录取工作安排</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院成立推免生复试专家组，坚持公平、公正、公开原则，落实集体议事和集体决策制度，以提高选拔质量为核心，坚持全面考查、突出能力考核，强化对考生科研创新潜质和专业能力倾向的考查。复试专家组负责审核考生申请材料，确定复试名单，并根据复试成绩，结合申请材料和综合素质考核结果，对考生进行综合评价，择优录取。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>）正式报名与复试</span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>21</span></span><span><span>日</span>9:00<span>，推免生开始报名。考生登录中国研究生招生信息网</span><span>“</span><span>全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开暨管理服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>（以下简称</span><span>“</span><span>推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>，网址：</span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span><span>）填报志愿。</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span><span>在推免服务系统该环节开启时</span></span></span><span><span>，学院开始审核考生申请材料，并向符合条件的考生发放复试通知。</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span><span>学院组织复试，开展综合能力考核。</span></span><span><span>同意参加复试的申请人按约定时间参加复试，由复试专家进行提问和考评。</span></span><span><span>具体复试时间、地点以复试通知为准，请考生保持通信畅通。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）录取</span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span><span>在推免服务系统该环节开启时</span></span></span><span><span>，学院开始发放待录取通知。学院根据考核成绩，向参加复试且考核合格的考生发放待录取通知。</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span><span>在推免服务系统该环节开启时</span></span></span><span><span>，考生开始确认待录取通知。学院按照考生确认待录取通知的时间顺序确定接收名单，额满为止。逾期未确认的，不再保留拟录取名额。</span></span></p><p><span>3.<span>学院通过推免服务系统发放复试通知或待录取通知后，考生须在规定时间内登录系统确认。逾期未确认的，经学院电话联系确认后，学院可按规定撤回相应通知。考生接受待录取通知后，原则上不得更改。</span></span></p><p><span>4.<span>待录取工作结束后，如招生计划仍有余额，学院将根据推免服务系统中的报名情况，从已参加复试且考核合格的考生中依次补录。</span></span></p><p><span><span>四、注意事项</span></span></p><p><span>1.<span>所有推免生（含硕士研究生、直博生）均须通过推免服务系统完成报名、复试确认和待录取确认等程序。</span></span></p><p><span>2.<span>考生须准确填写个人信息，并在推免工作期间保持电话畅通、电子邮箱使用正常。</span></span></p><p><span>3.<span>考生须对提交材料的真实性负责。凡弄虚作假者，一经查实，取消其复试或录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span>4.<span>考生须按照教育部有关规定，于</span></span><span><span>规定时间内</span></span><span><span>，登录推免服务系统完成网上报名及报名费缴纳。</span></span></p><p><span>5.<span>考生须在推免工作期间保持通信畅通，并按要求参加复试考核。</span></span></p><p><span>6.<span>考生收到复试通知或待录取通知后，须在规定时间内登录推免服务系统确认。</span></span></p><p><span><span>五、联系方式</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span><span>方</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span>027-</span><span><span>87651826</span></span></p><p><span><span>监督电话：</span>027-</span><span><span>87650057</span></span></p><p><span><span>地址：</span></span><span><span>武汉理工大学南湖校区物理与力学学院办公楼</span><span>313</span><span>办公室</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮政编码：</span>430070</span></p><p><span><span>武汉理工大学</span></span><span><span>物理与力学</span></span><span><span>学院</span></span></p><p><span>2026<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>17</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p></div>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>","textSha256":"d8b5b1e0c0b33ad9dd4356fad69f8affd934b4c0918f79fe1d5af16fc96a4b09","textLength":1744,"sourceSha256":"b2d2b8818ead2b021fa6d4fcd8083e82ce93da72b9307b1d972cdb3f79a52b19","selector":".article_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-edbce6c9d22b3231f405","title":"2026年武汉理工大学物理与力学学院2027年推荐免试攻读硕士学位（直接攻读博士学位）研究生招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:10.132043+00:00"}
